{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31053","headline":"送同儒大德归柏梯寺 · 薛能","name":"送同儒大德归柏梯寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柏梯还拟谢微官，遥拟千峰送法兰。\n行径未曾青石断，拂牀终有白云残。\n京尘濯後三衣洁，山舍禅初万象安。\n薇蕨纵多师莫踏，我心犹欲尽图看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31053.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31053","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}